       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved color contrast/readability on achievements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed not being able to close windows when a scrollbar is selected.",
